{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05778","headline":"寒食 · 卢象","name":"寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子推言避世，山火遂焚身。\n四海同寒食，千秋爲一人。\n深冤何用道，峻迹古无邻。\n魂魄山河气，风雷御宇神。\n光烟榆柳灭，怨曲龙虵新。\n可叹文公霸，平生负此臣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}